'''Hunter's Map III''' (狩人の地図ⅠⅠⅠ, ''Karyūdo no Chizu ⅠⅠⅠ'', '''Hunter's Map ⅠⅠⅠ''') is an [[Enigma Stages|Enigma]] map that has five stages, each with a different color Behemoth Stone drop. Upon clearing any one stage in Hunter's Map III, the map disappears until it is found again. It can only appear at Enigma Levels 6-9; once Level 10 is reached, it is permanently replaced by [[Hunter's Map IV]]. It was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

